      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The aigamuxa makes a claw Strike against a creature within reach. On a hit, the aigamuxa automatically Grabs the creature. Whether or not they hit, the aigamuxa then Strides. If they have a creature grabbed, the creature moves with the aigamuxa."
      ],
      "requirements": "The aigamuxa is Hiding in dirt, sand, or another soft surface"
    },
    {
      "name": "Burrowing Concealment",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 2,
        "symbol": "◆◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The aigamuxa quickly digs into the surface and Hides. They leave their feet partially exposed, allowing them to see out from the surface. The aigamuxa can hold their breath for up to 10 minutes while hiding in this way."
      ],
      "requirements": "The aigamuxa is standing on dirt, sand, or another soft surface"
    },
